    description: Some("Falling stars turn into brooms that fill a cavern with water, and Mickey has to keep it from flooding. On the mountains you catch stars in the sorcerer\'s hat or burst them with fireballs, and hitting a meteor yields two empty buckets. Slip down to the cavern and you stop brooms by running into them."),
